# semgrep allowlist — paths excluded from SAST.
#
# NOTE: a custom .semgrepignore REPLACES semgrep's built-in defaults, so the
# common noise dirs below are listed explicitly. To silence a single line
# instead of a whole path, use an inline `# nosemgrep: <rule-id>` comment WITH a
# justification next to the code — prefer that over adding paths here.

.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
tests/
graphify-out/
